          "id": "e4d3b0b4-759b-4b99-bd15-4e3130aa1b69",
          "memory": "On the morning of October 2, 2026 Ben lost his blue keyring with his house key, thinking it was on the kitchen counter. After checking the bowl by the door with only loose change, his backpack with old receipts and gum, couch cushions with crumbs and remote, and bathroom counter, he found it in the pocket of the grey coat he wore the chilly prior morning, saving a hardware store trip to re-cut the house key.",
