        },
        {
          "id": "0db743d3-9485-48f3-bc49-306e5747e78a",
          "memory": "On October 1, 2026 User ran a load of darks laundry and did not notice anything jingling, but noted the dryer made a thumping noise again on October 2, 2026, with Ben saying the dryer is on its last legs.",
